    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but 18mg seems so tiny if she's actually anemic... her doctor just said she needs iron, he didn't give a specific amount. if her levels are really low wouldn't a higher dose like 650mg just be more effective at fixing the problem quickly? i just hate seeing her so tired all the time.",
